# Bundle a Java runtime (Eclipse JustJ) in the macOS products only. Without
# one, the launcher searches for the user's Java and, on Apple Silicon, can
# fail with "JVM shared library ... does not contain the JNI_CreateJavaVM
# symbol". JustJ's install step points DebriefNG.ini's -vm at the bundled JRE.
requires.0.namespace=org.eclipse.equinox.p2.iu
requires.0.name=org.eclipse.justj.openjdk.hotspot.jre.full.stripped.feature.group
requires.0.range=0.0.0
requires.0.filter=(osgi.os=macosx)
